% task_domain — MiniHack's task: walk onto the goal, the specialists asked one goal at a time (semantic-world s-227b8e1b step 2, world/mh_hier.py): over roles, the level the host's map.
catalog task_domain 1.
provenance text "MiniHack's task: walk onto the goal, the specialists asked one goal at a time" "2026-10-25".
layers (dyn).
stages (act).
types (cell).
include "iface/minihack.llp".   % the family's crossing preds, declared once (tools/iface_gen.py)
namespace task produce (dyn).
pred want(cell) : task.
stage act {
  %% Stopped: I drop my goal.
  cancel_want [dyn] : tick__cancel(task) * want(V0) -o one.
  %% I'll walk onto {G}.
  go [dyn] : reach(G) -o want(G) * goto(G) * tick__active(task).
  %% I am on {G}: done.
  arrived [dyn] : want(G) * reached(G) -o done * tick__done(task).
  %% {X} was refused and I have no rule for it: I stop and ask.
  stuck_on [dyn] : want(G) * refused(X) -o stuck(X) * tick__stuck(task).
}
